    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Thornton Properties are proud to present The Seasons, an extraordinary architect-designed residence set amidst approximately 1.3 acres of beautifully landscaped grounds in a peaceful yet highly accessible Ashford location.\n\nOriginally transformed and extensively redesigned in 2010 to an exacting architectural specification, The Seasons is a home of remarkable quality where exceptional craftsmanship, thoughtful design and luxurious finishes combine to create a truly special family residence.\n\nApproached via a private laneway, electric gates open to reveal a sweeping driveway, mature gardens and expansive lawns that immediately set the tone for what lies beyond. Inside, a striking double-height entrance hall creates an unforgettable first impression, featuring a dramatic wood-burning fireplace and stunning solid cherrywood flooring that flows throughout much of the home.\n\nAt the heart of the property lies a spectacular bespoke kitchen designed by Darren Langrell. The elegant curved island with its distinctive primrose-yellow accent, Quartz worktops and extensive custom cabinetry creates a space that is as beautiful as it is functional. A range of premium appliances, including a Fisher & Paykel CoolDrawer, Neff induction hob, integrated ovens, steamer and warming drawers, will delight even the most discerning home chef. Flooded with natural light, the kitchen and dining area opens seamlessly through bifolding doors to the extensive patio and gardens, creating the perfect setting for indoor-outdoor living and entertaining.\n\nThe accommodation is equally impressive, offering four generously proportioned bedrooms, each finished with solid cherrywood flooring. Luxurious ensuite bathrooms and three walk-in wardrobes provide both comfort and practicality, ensuring ample space for family living.\n\nThe lower level presents a superb extension of the home's entertaining space. Complete with a second fully equipped kitchen, shower room and direct access to the gardens via patio doors, this versatile area is perfectly suited to hosting family gatherings, summer celebrations or poolside entertaining.\n\nEvery aspect of The Seasons reflects the care, investment and attention to detail of its current owners. Presented in turnkey condition, this is a home where a new owner can simply move in and begin enjoying an exceptional lifestyle from day one.\n\nDespite its tranquil and private setting, convenience is never compromised. The N11 is just five minutes away, providing excellent connectivity for commuters, while nearby Ashford Village offers a wealth of amenities including schools, shops, cafés, pubs, sporting facilities and a vibrant local community.\n\nThe Seasons represents a rare opportunity to acquire a truly distinguished home where luxury, privacy and accessibility come together in perfect harmony."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.52m x 10.78m\nWith Cherrywood flooring, vaulted ceiling with large velux windows and a wall inset wood burning fire.Double doors lead to\n\nHotpress / cloakroom - 3.57m x 1.63m\nWith plenty of built in storage.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.39m x 9.69m\nFeaturing a custom made hand painted kitchen with extensive storage including high end integrated appliances and eye catching curved counter and Quartz counters throughout.The dual aspect windows and bi folding patio doors ensure the room is flooded with natural light.\n\nLiving Room - 5.89m x 6.56m\nWell proportioned living room with Cherrywood floors, feature floor to ceiling bay window and wall inset wood burning fire.\n\nGalleried Landing - 3.34m x 7.73m\nCherrywood floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - 8.29m x 4.93m\nAttractive primary suite with plenty of natural light and a solid Cherrywood floor.\n\nEn-suite Bathroom - 2.82m x 2.98m\nWith stylish tiling and Villeroy and Boch sanitary ware including a corner jacuzzi bath, wc, wash hand basin, bidet and heated towel rail.\n\nDressing Room - 4.72m x 5.85m\nSpacious room with large velux windows and a cherrywood floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 7.03m x 5.82m\nSpacious double bedroom with dual aspect windows and Cherrywood flooring.\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 2.69m x 2.70m\nWith ample built in hanging space and shelving.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.75m x 4m\nLarge ensuite with walk in oversize rainfall shower, wc, wash hand basin and heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.74m x 3.66m\nDouble bedroom with a Cherrywood floor and views to the front lawns.\n\nWalk-in Wardrobe - 1.63m x 3.28m\nCherrywood flooring and walnut built in open wardrobes and storage.\n\nShower Room - 1.32m x 3.28m\nWet room style ensuite with power shower, wc, floating wash hand basin and heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.29m x 4.22m\nDouble bedroom with a cherrywood floor and views to the rear gardens.\n\nWalk-in Wardrobe - 3.34m x 3.75m\nWith built in wardrobe and hanging space.\n\nEn-suite - 1.30m x 3.75m\nWet room style ensuite with power shower, wc and wash hand basin.\n\nGym/Games Room - 6.79m x 11.41m\nThe lower level offer a super second reception space with a Cherrywood timber floor and dual aspect full lenght windows and patio doors leading out to the rear patio.\n\nKitchen - 4.14m x 5.78m\nFully fitted kitchen with extensive built in storage, Free standing dual electric & gas cooker, plumbing for a dishwasher and washing machine.Patio doors lead out to the rear garden.\n\nComms - 4.14m x 2.33m\n\n\nShower Room - 2.24m x 3.75m\nFully tiled wet room style shower room with wc.\n\n"
